  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning Kemikalieinspektionen Tunisien (fas 3)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Twinning Swedish Chemicals Agency Tunisia phas3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Twinning med Kemikalieinspektionen. Sidas st&#xf6;d inom detta beslut      avser Kemikalieinspektionens kostnader f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberedelse och           genomf&#xf6;rande av studiebes&#xf6;k inom Twinningprojektet &quot;Appui             institutionnel en mati&#xe8;re de gestion et de contr&#xf4;le des substances    chimiques&quot; TU11/ENP-AP/EN28(fas 3).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twinning with Swedish Chemicals Agency. Sida&apos;s support within this    decision is intended for the Swedish Chemicals Agency&apos;s costs for     preparations and implementation of study visits within the Twinning   Project &quot;Appui institutionnel en mati&#xe8;re de gestion et de contr&#xf4;le    des substances chimiques.&quot; TU11/ENP-AP/EN28(phase 3).</narrative>
  </description>
